    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The one traversal `Gesture` admits: each constructor's case, with the" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// recursive fields already folded." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// `A` and not `EventTrack(WrittenTime)`, because the whole point of having" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// the plan as a value is that two readings fold the same plan — one into" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// notation and one into a count. The gesture comes last because that is" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// how a case is written at a call, and the recursion descends on it while" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// every argument before it stays fixed (§2.4's measure)." },
